# HAIDA MUSLIMAH SALON  
## Digital Salon Ecosystem (Web App) — Full Project Brief + Tech & Security

---

## 1) Executive Overview

**HAIDA MUSLIMAH SALON** will implement a **web-based Salon Management System** that unifies core daily operations into a single ecosystem:

- POS / Sales (receipt, payments)
- Booking + Deposit
- Customer Database (~8,000 customers)
- Loyalty Points (Admin-controlled)
- Commission (by service, assigned to stylist selected in POS)
- Inventory (stock in/out/adjust, low stock alert)
- Reporting (Admin only)

This system is intended to be **demo-ready quickly** and **scalable for production**.

---

## 2) Business Goals

1. **One system** for all salon operations (reduce Excel/manual errors).
2. Faster daily execution (POS & booking).
3. Accurate and transparent commission by service.
4. Controlled and auditable customer points.
5. Inventory visibility (low stock alerts, movement history).
6. Owner/Admin dashboards & reports to monitor performance.

