## 4) User Roles (Strictly 2 Roles Only)

### 4.1 Admin (Owner/Management)
**Full system access**
- Services + pricing + commission rates
- Points rules & adjustment
- Inventory item master, stock in/out/adjust, cost visibility
- View all reports & dashboards
- Lock month (optional)
- Settings

### 4.2 Staff (Cashier/Front desk)
**Limited operational access**
- POS / Sales
- Booking & Deposit
- Inventory: view-only or usage-only (no cost, no adjust)
- Can select stylist during POS
- View customer points (read-only)

**Staff restrictions**
- Cannot adjust points
- Cannot edit commission rates
- Cannot access admin reports or settings
- Cannot do stock adjustments
- Cannot view inventory cost price

> Admin-only actions must be **hidden** (not disabled) for staff users.

