## 9) Data Migration (~8,000 Customers)

### 9.1 Migration Approach (Safe)
1) Export current customer database to CSV
2) Import to staging table
3) Normalize phone format (Malaysia)
4) Detect duplicates by phone
5) Insert into main customers table
6) If existing points exist, insert as opening ledger balance

### 9.2 Search Performance
- Index on `phone_canonical` (unique)
- Index on `full_name` (optional)
- Use standardized phone format for fast matching

